 to move faster and smarter. Easy to learn, and easy to master.\n\nIf you love high energy VR movement and games that reward practice and precision, Primal Monks is for you.", "short_description": "Primal Monks is a chill VR game focused on arm based movement. Swing, climb, and have fun with other players. \n\nSkill, momentum, and practice are the core of the game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/lucasongorillatag-netizen/Primal-Monks-Privacy-Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zollex", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/lucasongorillatag-netizen", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26009888698637107"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1789726778292772"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1789726778292772"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1770058740, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1789726778292772"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26035579389401371", "version": "1.2"}, "id": "1587232895876194", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_applicat